        dc:contributor      "GOC:reactome_curators" , "Authored: Jassal, Bijay, 2015-01-30" , "Edited: Jassal, Bijay, 2015-01-30" , "Reviewed: Ware, Carl F, Virgen-Slane, Richard, Rajput, Akhil, 2015-05-12" ;
